body:
@btmills you are right the problem is in `max-len`.

Here is a minimal example:
- eslintrc

``` json
{
     "env": {
         "node": true
     },
     "rules": {
         "no-func-assign": 2,
         "max-len": [2, 120]
     }
}
```
- foo.js

``` js
// blank line here
var foo = module.exports = {};
```
- run `eslint foo.js`

Looking at the code `max-len` [modifies the node range](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/blob/1ae31042e64c58864804db69ebc2f49ce98112ef/lib/rules/max-len.js#L46).
